    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate Key contractual and regulatory risks associated with this project, we can propose a contract that includes provisions for: 1. the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) compliance: we will ensure that the solution is designed and implemented in accordance with the the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) principles, including data minimization, transparency, and security. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Human oversight and validation: the solution will be designed as a tool of assistance, with no automated decisions without explicit validation by an agent. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quality of service: we will guarantee a high level of quality of service, including availability, reliability, and performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By incorporating provisions for human oversight and validation, which align with the client's expectations into we contract, we can ensure that the solution meets the client's requirements and minimizes the associated contractual and regulatory risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual operating cost that must remain controlled and compatible with the City of Belval's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimization strategies our can propose to ensure the solution's affordability?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our target gross margin percentage is 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our also have a minimum acceptable margin percentage of 18%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To determine our projected margin on this contract, our would need to calculate the total cost of delivering the solution's, which is not explicitly stated in our context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, considering The client's global budget, our can attempt to provide a rough estimate." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our can deliver the solution's within The client's global budget, our revenue from this contract would be a portion of the 3 million euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Let's assume our revenue is x euros.  our pricing model does not provide a direct way to calculate the cost of delivering the solution's." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our pricing model does mention that our fixed costs are 35% of the project cost, and variable costs are 65% of the project cost." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given this information, our can propose cost-optimization strategies to ensure the solution's affordability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, our could explore ways to reduce our fixed and variable costs, such as renegotiating rates with subcontractors or optimizing resource allocation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company context mentions that a 10% budget reduction would allow our to absorb the impact via rate renegotiation with subcontractors, while a 20% reduction would require scope reduction." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This information could be useful in negotiating with The client's and proposing cost-optimization strategies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide a more accurate estimate of our projected margin on this contract, our would need more information about the specific costs associated with delivering the solution's." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, based on our target gross margin percentage of 28%, our can aim to achieve a margin within our target gross margin percentage of 28%, while also ensuring that a margin within this range remains above our minimum acceptable margin of 18%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of cost-optimization strategies, our could propose the following: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Renegotiate rates with subcontractors to reduce fixed and variable costs. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Optimize resource allocation to minimize waste and reduce variable costs. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Explore scope reduction options if the client is willing to consider a 20% budget reduction." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By proposing these cost-optimization strategies, our can work with the client to ensure the solution's affordability while maintaining our projected margin on this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial intelligence solution that assists agents in agents daily missions, improves quality of answers, and reduces processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we leverage we LLM stack, RAG capabilities, and fine-tuning methods to develop a innovative AI-powered solution that meets these requirements and provides a competitive edge?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client requirements, we can leverage our LLM stack, specifically we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong French-language performance and is self-hostable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By fine-tuning our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong French-language performance and is self-hostable using we established methods, such as LoRA, QLoRA, or full fine-tune on a domain corpus, we can adapt our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong French-language performance and is self-hostable to The client specific needs, improving our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong French-language performance and is self-hostable ability to provide accurate and relevant answers. we RAG capabilities can be utilized to enhance our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong French-language performance and is self-hostable performance in retrieving information from internal procedures and applicable regulation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing we retrieval strategies, such as dense vector semantic search or hybrid approaches, we can ensure that our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong French-language performance and is self-hostable provides the most relevant information to agents, thereby improving the quality of answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce processing times, we can optimize our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong French-language performance and is self-hostable inference speed through quantization methods like INT8 or INT4 (GPTQ), allowing for faster response times while maintaining a high level of accuracy. we typical retrieval precision at 5 of 0.87 and answer relevance score of 0.84 demonstrate the potential for Our RAG capabilities to provide accurate and relevant information efficiently." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these technologies, we can develop an innovative AI-powered solution that assists agents in agents daily missions, improves the quality of answers, and reduces processing times. an innovative AI-powered solution that assists agents in their daily missions, improves the quality of answers, and reduces processing times will not only meet the client's requirements but also provide a competitive edge by leveraging we expertise in LLMs, RAG, and fine-tuning methods." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we approach will ensure compliance with key constraints such as data sovereignty, security, and environmental considerations, aligning with the client's expectations for a responsible and efficient AI solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval aims to limit The City of Belval environmental footprint, reduce energetic consumption, and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can our proposed solution contribute to aims, and what eco-friendly practices can our implement in our project delivery to minimize our environmental impact?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can assure that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. is committed to sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have a silver Ecovadis rating with a score of 62, indicating Nexus Engineering S.r.l. efforts towards environmental responsibility." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To contribute to aims, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which are located in France and use 100% renewable energy. leverage can significantly reduce the carbon footprint associated with data hosting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also employ digital sobriety practices that can help minimize energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. use INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy by approximately 40%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. auto-scaling feature allows Nexus Engineering S.r.l. to scale down to zero outside business hours, reducing unnecessary energy usage." ;
