        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining our company's strengths, our company's can propose a comprehensive solution that integrates with existing systems, ensures high availability, and provides a tool for assisting users in users daily missions. our company's dedicated change manager can work closely with the City of Belval's agents to provide accompaniment to change and training, ensuring a smooth transition to our proposed solution. our company's will also maintain a risk register and conduct bi-weekly risk reviews to identify and mitigate potential risks, aligning with our company's low-to-medium risk appetite." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By working together as a consortium, our company's can deliver a solution that not only meets but exceeds the City of Belval's expectations, ultimately contributing to the City of Belval's digital transformation strategy and improving the efficiency and quality of the City of Belval's administrative services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires response times below 2 seconds, high availability (99.9%), API integration with existing information systems and user directories, and hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU, with no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requirements can be addressed as follows: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response times below 2 seconds: our performance benchmarks indicate a p95 response time of 1800 ms for RAG responses, which is below the 2-second threshold." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our need to consider additional latency introduced by API integrations and other components." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, a p95 response time of 1800 ms for RAG responses, which is below the 2-second threshold is PARTIALLY COVERED. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "High availability (99.9%): our have achieved an availability of 99.92% on past projects, which exceeds the required 99.9%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "High availability (99.9%): is FULLY COVERED. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with existing information systems and user directories: our integration capabilities include API standards such as REST, GraphQL, and SOAP, as well as API gateways like Kong and Apigee. our also have experience with identity providers like Active Directory/LDAP and Keycloak." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This requirement is FULLY COVERED. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU, with no dependency on non-European suppliers: our have experience with cloud providers like OVHcloud, Scaleway, and Outscale (SecNumCloud), which are all based in the EU. our proposed architecture would utilize one of cloud providers like OVHcloud, Scaleway, and Outscale (SecNumCloud), which are all based in the EU to ensure sovereignty and minimal dependence on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This requirement is FULLY COVERED." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed architecture would involve designing a solution that integrates our AI/ML capabilities with the client's existing information systems and user directories using APIs. our would deploy a solution that integrates our AI/ML capabilities with the client's existing information systems and user directories using APIs on a sovereign cloud infrastructure within the EU, ensuring high availability and response times below 2 seconds. our technical expertise in areas like cybersecurity, data engineering, and cloud architecture would enable our to implement the required security measures and ensure the scalability of a solution that integrates our AI/ML capabilities with the client's existing information systems and user directories using APIs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable), explicability and transparency of AI outputs, and no automated decision without explicit validation by an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience with the GDPR regulatory framework and have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed, which is a positive step towards compliance. we standard data residency policy is EU-only, and we have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers outside EU unless there's an explicit legal basis, aligning with the requirements. we also have tools for anonymization, such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models, which can help with pseudonymisation of sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we implement data subject rights including access, rectification, erasure, portability, and objection, further supporting GDPR compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding explicability and transparency of AI outputs, our company context does not explicitly mention capabilities for explaining AI decisions or providing transparent outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we do have experience with conducting Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIA), which could be beneficial in assessing the privacy risks associated with AI processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For the requirement of no automated decision without explicit validation by an agent, our company context indicates that we have a constraint where a decision will not be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This aligns with GDPR requirements regarding automated decision-making." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for legal risks, we should flag potential issues related to ensuring that all data processing activities are properly documented and subject to DPIA when necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, ensuring that we AI systems provide sufficient transparency and explainability in our AI systems outputs could be a challenge, given that provide is not explicitly mentioned in our company context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, with we existing experience in GDPR compliance and the tools at we disposal for anonymization and data protection, we have a solid foundation to meet these regulatory requirements, provided we can address the need for transparent AI decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects compliance with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR), and the solution must be designed as a tool of assistance with no automated decisions without explicit validation by an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the key contractual and regulatory risks associated with this project, and how can we ensure that the solution meets the key contractual and regulatory risks associated with this project?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expectations regarding the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) compliance and the design of the solution as a tool of assistance with no automated decisions without explicit validation by an agent are crucial." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience with public procurement in several EU jurisdictions, including Italy, France, Germany, Belgium, and EU institutions. we are also familiar with the French Code Commande Publique." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) compliance, we standard legal basis for processing personal data is Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest. we have a Data Protection Agreement (DPA) template version 3.2 that we can use as a starting point for this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we have experience with data protection impact assessments (DPIAs) and can support the client in this regard." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure that the solution meets the requirements of being designed as a tool of assistance with no automated decisions without explicit validation by an agent, we will need to incorporate contractual provisions that reflect the requirements of being designed as a tool of assistance with no automated decisions without explicit validation by an agent. we standard contractual clauses include provisions for human oversight and validation, which align with The client expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Key contractual and regulatory risks associated with this project include ensuring the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) compliance, avoiding any prohibited AI practices, and guaranteeing the quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

